Summary: Start a 64-bit program at its entry point when its random base was already taken
Category: system
Kind: fix
Origin: winehq
  Commit: d87fb2f52ea9379a3bb04dd1753b46af805141da
  Authors: Alexandre Julliard
  URL: https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/commit/d87fb2f52ea9379a3bb04dd1753b46af805141da
  Changes: verbatim
  Note: "server: Update the PE image info for relocated executables on the
    server side." (2026-11-16, after 11.22). Replaces our own fix of
    2026-11-21, which corrected only ntdll's copy of the image information.
Upstream: yes (d87fb2f5, after Wine 11.22)
Needed until: 11.23 (WineHQ d87fb2f5, in master after 11.22)
Why: Since Wine 11.22, the server gives each 64-bit exe a random base. When
 that range is already in use in the new process, the exe is mapped
 somewhere else, but the image information kept the assigned address, so
 TransferAddress pointed into the wrong place and the main thread started
 at an address with nothing there. The server now updates the image
 information for relocated executables, and ntdll uses it.
Programs: Nancy Drew games (Shadow at the Water's Edge, Sea of Darkness):
 start.exe crashes at its entry point before the game starts (11.22)
Status: 11.22: 2026-11-26: replaced by WineHQ's d87fb2f5 (patch review); not
 yet in a build. Our earlier fix passed exe-base-taken on 11.22.
 11.22: 2026-11-26: quick builds 20261126T002454 and T025644 (macOS 26.7.2,
 M1 Max): smoke and the regression suite passed

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c
index c6b9aefe92d2..e8a93a5c40bf 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c
@@ -6366,8 +6366,7 @@ NTSTATUS WINAPI NtUnmapViewOfSectionEx( HANDLE process, PVOID addr, ULONG flags
  */
 void virtual_fill_image_information( const struct pe_image_info *pe_info, SECTION_IMAGE_INFORMATION *info )
 {
-    client_ptr_t base = pe_info->map_addr ? pe_info->map_addr : pe_info->base;
-    info->TransferAddress             = wine_server_get_ptr( base + pe_info->entry_point );
+    info->TransferAddress             = wine_server_get_ptr( pe_info->base + pe_info->entry_point );
     info->ZeroBits                    = pe_info->zerobits;
     info->MaximumStackSize            = pe_info->stack_size;
     info->CommittedStackSize          = pe_info->stack_commit;
diff --git a/server/mapping.c b/server/mapping.c
index d1b0fc3da2d8..4264ba51b56d 100644
--- a/server/mapping.c
+++ b/server/mapping.c
@@ -461,6 +461,7 @@ static int add_process_view( struct thread *thread, struct memory_view *view )
             if (get_view_nt_name( view, &name ) && (process->image = memdup( name.str, name.len )))
                 process->imagelen = name.len;
             process->image_info = view->image;
+            process->image_info.base = view->base;
             list_add_head( &process->views, &view->entry );
             return 1;
         }
